 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The professions",
   "texto": [
    "To ask what one does: **Was bist du von Beruf?** (with «Sie»: **Was sind Sie von Beruf?**).",
    "**sin artículo**: **Ich bin Lehrer** (I am a teacher) is answered.",
    "The feminine adds **-in**: Lehrer → **Lehrerin**, Student → **Studentin**. Sometimes the vowel changes: Arzt → **Ärztin**.",
    "To deny a name, **kein** is used, not «nicht»: **Sie sind keine Studenten** (not students)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The regular present",
   "texto": [
    "Almost all verbs are conjugated equally: **-en** is removed and the terminations are added. **wir** and **sie/Sie** are equal to the infinitive.",
    "If the root ends in -t or -d, a **e** is inserted to be able to pronounce it: **du arbeitest**, **er arbeitet**."
   ]
  },
